# Day 26 - Prior Authorization Workflow Simulator

## 📌 Project Overview

Today I built an **AI-powered Prior Authorization Workflow Simulator** using Claude AI. The application simulates the healthcare prior authorization process through an interactive workflow, helping users understand how insurance approvals are processed between patients, healthcare providers, and insurance companies.

This project demonstrates how AI can generate complete browser applications that simplify complex business workflows using interactive UI and gamification.

---

## 🚀 Features

- Interactive healthcare workflow simulation
- Step-by-step authorization process
- Patient, Provider, and Insurance roles
- Decision-based workflow navigation
- Progress tracking
- Responsive modern UI
- Fully browser-based (HTML, CSS & JavaScript)
- AI-generated application with Claude

---

## 🔄 Workflow

1. Patient submits treatment request
2. Healthcare provider creates authorization request
3. Insurance company reviews submission
4. Additional documents requested (if needed)
5. Medical review process
6. Approval or rejection decision
7. Final workflow summary

